sequenceDiagram
    participant GitHub as GitHub
    participant FunctionApp as Function App
    participant SREAgent as SRE Agent Core
    participant OpenAI as Azure OpenAI
    participant Search as Azure Cognitive Search
    participant GitHubAPI as GitHub API
    participant LogicAppPost as Logic App: Post to Teams
    participant Teams as Microsoft Teams
    participant User as Teams User
    participant LogicAppListen as Logic App: Listen to Teams

    %% Initial Issue Triage Flow
    GitHub->>FunctionApp: POST /api/TriageGithubIssue
    FunctionApp->>SREAgent: Invoke SRE Agent
    SREAgent->>OpenAI: Query agent model
    SREAgent->>Search: Query indexed knowledge
    SREAgent->>GitHubAPI: Fetch issue details
    SREAgent-->>LogicAppPost: Compose response
    LogicAppPost->>Teams: Post message to thread

    %% User Interaction Flow
    User->>Teams: Reply in Teams thread
    Teams->>LogicAppListen: Auto-trigger on reply
    LogicAppListen->>FunctionApp: POST /api/TriageGithubIssueReply
    FunctionApp->>SREAgent: Invoke SRE Agent
    SREAgent->>OpenAI: Query agent model
    SREAgent->>Search: Query indexed knowledge
    SREAgent->>GitHubAPI: Optional context retrieval
    SREAgent-->>LogicAppPost: Compose follow-up response
    LogicAppPost->>Teams: Post reply in thread
